#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:3
msgid "Version 4.4.6"
msgstr "버전 4.4.6"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:5
msgid "Release Date: February 24, 2024"
msgstr "릴리스 날짜: 2024년 2월 24일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:7
msgid "**4.4.6 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.4.6 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:15
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr "주요 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:18
msgid "Time::createFromTimestamp()"
msgstr "Time::createFromTimestamp()"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:20
msgid ""
"A bug that caused :ref:`Time::createFromTimestamp() <time-"
"createfromtimestamp>` to return a Time instance with a timezone of UTC "
"has been fixed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Time::createFromTimestamp() <time-createfromtimestamp>`\ 가 UTC 시간대의 "
"Time 인스턴스를 반환하던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:23
msgid ""
"Starting with this version, when you do not specify a timezone, a Time "
"instance with the app's timezone is returned by default."
msgstr "이 버전부터는 시간대를 지정하지 않으면 기본적으로 앱의 시간대를 가진 Time 인스턴스가 반환됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:28
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Session:** Fixed a bug in Redis session handler that caused locking to "
"fail and the session data to be cleared."
msgstr "**세션:** 잠금이 실패하고 세션 데이터가 지워지던 Redis 세션 핸들러의 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:32
msgid ""
"**DB Forge:** Fixed a bug in SQLite3 Forge that caused "
"``Forge::modifyColumn()`` to incorrectly modify table definitions."
msgstr "**DB Forge:** ``Forge::modifyColumn()``\ 이 테이블 정의를 잘못 수정하던 SQLite3 Forge의 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:34
msgid "**CSP:** Fixed a bug that CSP blocked some elements in the Debug Toolbar."
msgstr "**CSP:** CSP가 Debug Toolbar의 일부 요소를 차단하던 버그가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.4.6.rst:36
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
